---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import VideoPlayer from '../components/VideoPlayer.astro';
import Amazon from '../components/Amazon.astro';
import { path } from '../site';
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
const chapter = await getEntry('chapters', 'book-one-chapter-one');
if (!chapter?.body) throw new Error('Missing opening chapter for the film-to-book preview');
const opening = chapter.body.trim().split(/\r?\n\s*\r?\n/).slice(0, 3);
---
<Layout alternates={[{lang:'en',route:'movie/'},{lang:'fr',route:'fr/film/'},{lang:'ar',route:'ar/film/'},{lang:'tr',route:'tr/film/'},{lang:'x-default',route:'movie/'}]} title="The Mothers Monster (2026): Watch the Film" description="Watch The Mothers Monster (2026), also titled She Gave Birth to a Dragon. Discover the fantasy film, its premise, and a dark fantasy novel by YH.">
<section class="section watch-page">
<p class="eyebrow">THE FANTASY FILM · 2026</p>
<h1>The Mothers<br/><em>Monster</em></h1>
<p class="lead">Watch <i>The Mothers Monster</i> by MYTHRA, then discover <i>A Monster’s Mother: A Cradle Made of Embers</i>.</p>
<nav aria-label="Page language"><a href={path('movie/')} lang="en">English</a> · <a href={path('fr/film/')} lang="fr">Français</a> · <a href={path('ar/film/')} lang="ar">العربية</a> · <a href={path('tr/film/')} lang="tr">Türkçe</a></nav><VideoPlayer/>
<div class="film-notes">
<h2>She Gave Birth to a Dragon</h2>
<p>A young woman in a frozen mountain village gives birth to a dragon. While the village sees a threat, she sees her son. This is the premise of <i>The Mothers Monster</i>, the fantasy film published by MYTHRA on 14 September 2026.</p>
<h2>Where can I watch The Mothers Monster film?</h2>
<p>Use the embedded YouTube player above, or follow the source link beneath it. The video is published under the title <i>She Gave Birth to a Dragon | The Mothers Monster | Full Fantasy Movie 4K</i>. Playback availability and language options are controlled by YouTube and the publisher.</p>
<h2>Looking for the “Mother Monster movie”?</h2>
<p>If you mean the story of a mother who gives birth to a dragon, the video above is <i>The Mothers Monster</i>. Similar wording can lead to unrelated films, so check the title and publisher.</p>
<h2>The film and A Monster’s Mother: two titles to distinguish</h2>
<p><i>The Mothers Monster</i> is the video title. <i>A Monster’s Mother: A Cradle Made of Embers</i> is the book by YH featured on this site. Explore Elara and Ember’s story in the free opening chapter below.</p>
</div>
<!-- Future website advertising belongs below the player, never over its controls. No ad scripts are enabled. -->
</section>
<section class="book-band" aria-labelledby="book-opening">
<p class="eyebrow">FROM WATCHING TO READING · YH</p>
<h2 id="book-opening">Begin with “The First Breath”.</h2>
<p>The film is <i>The Mothers Monster</i>. The novel is <i>A Monster’s Mother: A Cradle Made of Embers</i>, by YH. If the bond between a mother and her dragon child brought you here, start with the opening of Elara and Ember’s story.</p>
<blockquote class="opening-preview" cite={path('read/')}>
  {opening.map(paragraph => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
</blockquote>
<p class="preview-credit">From “The First Breath” · Book I, Chapter One · YH</p>
<p>Chapter One is free to read on this site, in English, with no sign-up. It is an excerpt, not the complete novel. The paperback includes black-and-white illustrations.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="button secondary" href={path('read/')}>Continue Chapter One free (English) →</a><Amazon/></div>
<p class="reader-next"><a href={path('story/')}>About the book</a> · <a href={path('characters/ember/')}>Meet Ember</a> · <a href={path('blog/monstrous-motherhood/')}>Why a mother protects a “monster”</a></p>
</section>
</Layout>
<style>.watch-page{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding-top:8rem}.watch-page h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6rem);line-height:1.05}.watch-page .lead{max-width:760px;margin:2rem 0}.actions{justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.film-notes{max-width:760px;margin:3rem auto 0}.film-notes h2{font-size:2rem;margin-top:2.5rem}.film-notes p{line-height:1.8}.book-band>p{max-width:760px;margin-inline:auto}.opening-preview{max-width:760px;margin:2rem auto 1rem;padding:1.5rem;text-align:left;border-inline-start:2px solid var(--copper,#c08050);background:#191714}.opening-preview p{font-family:Georgia,serif;line-height:1.8}.preview-credit{font-size:.9rem;color:#c7bcae}.reader-next{line-height:2}.reader-next a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.2em}@media(max-width:600px){.opening-preview{padding:1rem}.actions .button{white-space:normal}}</style>
